To add to what Fereshteh said, to change permissions you want to use the "chmod" command and to change owners you want to use "chown". Google should turn up lots of articles about each command. I think changing the ownership rather than permissions is probably the better approach in this case. Or better yet, have a dedicated subdirectory of your app where you write data, and only chown that subdirectory.

